## 4. DTOs
No hand-written owner DTOs exist. They are generated from `openapi.yml`. Schema for `OwnerFields` (→ `OwnerFieldsDto`) at `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml` lines 1991–2039: string fields firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone; telephone `pattern: '^[0-9]*$'`, minLength 1, maxLength 20; all five `required`. `Owner` (→ `OwnerDto`, lines 2040–2063) = `allOf OwnerFields` + `id` (readOnly int) + `pets` (readOnly array, required). `OwnerPage` (→ `OwnerPageDto`) at 2064+.

## 5. Escalation handlers (owner-related)
YAMLs under `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/officefloor/escalation/` map an exception FQN → a handler class. Relevant to owner creation:

- `...InvalidTelephoneException.yml` → `org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.escalation.InvalidTelephoneHandler`
- `...MissingOwnerFieldsException.yml` → `MissingOwnerFieldsHandler`
- `org.springframework.dao.DataIntegrityViolationException.yml` → `DataIntegrityViolationExceptionHandler`
